    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Jas",
      "key": "Sat2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Sometimes I look for crawdads in the river. Don't tell Aunt Marnie... but I fed one to a cow once.#$e#She loved it.",
      "translation": "Někdy v řece hledám raky. Neříkej to tetě Marnie... ale jednou jsem jednoho dala krávě.#$e#Moc jí chutnal.",
      "sourceSHA256": "01ff086bf5654ba50bbb481246bdb21faace5de6ff7aad5a240cedd6b689d9d7",
      "translationSHA256": "0eea7fc24c03812ed52d07f5810811743522a0e343765438425d3eb91caba57e",
      "reviewChecks": [
