    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Jas",
      "key": "Sun2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Shane's gone a lot, and Aunt Marnie is busy all the time... so I have to invent my own games.#$e#I'm thankful for all my toys.$h",
      "translation": "Shane je často pryč a teta Marnie má pořád moc práce... takže si musím vymýšlet vlastní hry.#$e#Jsem vděčná za všechny své hračky.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "7d0333910197e9bef51a7d19c898c728d3473eaac5dc7f3900abaa87b1bf411c",
      "translationSHA256": "992c427d360781a3b34895ae0e0f6e2e9247c4bba284c7e81649adf1fa7779a6",
      "reviewChecks": [
